<title>USA: Worldwide Leisure names Dahlin president.</title>
<headline>Worldwide Leisure names Dahlin president.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worldwide Leisure Corp said Thursday it named Roger Dahlin president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Dahlin will coordinate the company's marketing and shareholder communications efforts as Worldwide prepares to launch expansion, acquisition and development programs, the company said.</p>
<p>Worldwide said it expects to make announcements on initial acquisitions in the area of destination resorts, wellness facilities and gaming in the next 30 days.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
